OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers asked to plan ahead for
OL,4,Anine-day closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail passengers in parts of west Kent
OL,7,Fand East Sussex are being asked to plan
OL,8,Fahead due to a nine-day closure of a
OL,9,Fstretch of track for improvements.
OL,11,FThe line between Tonbridge and Wadhurst
OL,12,Fwill be closed from 24 October to 1
OL,13,FNovember, with the closure extending to
OL,14,FBattle on the final day.
OL,16,FNetwork Rail said the works were
OL,17,F"essential" and would affect
OL,18,Freliability, safety and performance on
OL,19,Fthe Hastings line.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
