OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers asked to plan ahead for
OL,4,Anine-day closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FBuses will replace trains where they
OL,7,Fcan't run, but services from Tonbridge
OL,8,Fto London, Ashford and Redhill will be
OL,9,Funaffected by the closure. A shuttle
OL,10,Ftrain service will operate between
OL,11,FWadhurst and Hastings.
